      "mergeID": "62fea3b6646c5d7484ac7124",
      "mergedPostDetails": "# Issue:\nIf you have the Earmuff Visualization disabled because you don't want to see it all the time, the only way to just quickly see it is to change one of the sliders, or to enabled and disable the visualization for a second. This makes it hard if you just quickly want to check what the range is set to.\n# Suggestion:\nI have 2 ideas of how this could be improved:\n1. Show the Earmuff overlay when you have the Quick Menu open, just like it's currently done for the Status on Nameplates.\n2. Show the Earmuff overlay when hovering above the Earmuff section in the Quick Menu with your ray cast.\nThis would make it easier to quickly see what it's set to, without first having to turn on the overlay.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1220] Change when Earmuff Visualization is shown",
